1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 4=

4
00:00:58,200 --> 00:00:59,520
This ink is rather distinctive.

5
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:19,760
You're

6
00:01:19,870 --> 00:01:21,230
Princess Yun Fang's study companion?

7
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:23,680
(It actually worked.)

8
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:25,430
(In all thirty-three
previous lifetimes,)

9
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:27,070
(he never once gave me a second glance,)

10
00:01:27,350 --> 00:01:28,790
(much less approached me first.)

11
00:01:28,790 --> 00:01:30,140
(Grand Tutor's Daughter, Yu Feilin)

12
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:33,430
Your Highness.

13
00:01:33,430 --> 00:01:34,280
There you are.

14
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:36,510
Princess Yun Fang and I

15
00:01:36,510 --> 00:01:37,700
were just about to look for you.

16
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:42,680
I'm sorry.

17
00:01:42,870 --> 00:01:44,200
I didn't notice it.

18
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:45,400
Besides,

19
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:47,310
it's only a small ink stick.

20
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:48,760
Your Highness,

21
00:01:49,070 --> 00:01:49,870
I heard

22
00:01:49,870 --> 00:01:52,310
the Hanlin Academy received
a new batch of pine-soot ink today.

23
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:53,920
It has a light, elegant fragrance.

24
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,480
Why don't we go take a look?

25
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:56,640
All right.

26
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:57,710
Your...

27
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:02,920
(I still)

28
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:04,480
(failed.)

29
00:02:19,750 --> 00:02:21,080
There's nothing wrong

30
00:02:21,430 --> 00:02:22,590
with her makeup or attire.

31
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,400
Her fear of those in authority

32
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:27,360
is what she needs to overcome most.

33
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:30,470
I need to teach her
to read people's intentions

34
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:32,150
and their expressions,

35
00:02:32,590 --> 00:02:34,360
so when the right moment comes,

36
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,910
she'll know
when to boldly cross the line.

37
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:57,520
Come here.

38
00:03:08,870 --> 00:03:10,030
Your Highness.

39
00:03:20,870 --> 00:03:22,240
Sense where I am.

40
00:03:34,630 --> 00:03:36,430
Here?

41
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:42,120
Come closer.

42
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,310
Feel my heartbeat.

43
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:19,480
A steady heartbeat means I'm calm.

44
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:20,830
A rapid one

45
00:04:20,830 --> 00:04:22,510
means I'm excited or furious.

46
00:04:23,190 --> 00:04:24,310
What is it now?

47
00:04:29,630 --> 00:04:31,600
Steady.

48
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:32,070
Good.

49
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,360
Push me away.

50
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,190
I wouldn't dare.

51
00:04:35,430 --> 00:04:36,360
You wouldn't dare?

52
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:39,310
That day at Ruanhong Pavilion,

53
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:41,360
when you were threatening to die

54
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,600
over your ill-fated parents,

55
00:04:42,950 --> 00:04:43,830
you had plenty of nerve then.

56
00:04:50,310 --> 00:04:51,310
Your strength is adequate,

57
00:04:51,830 --> 00:04:52,800
but your technique needs work.

58
00:04:53,630 --> 00:04:54,870
From now on,

59
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:57,390
don't show me

60
00:04:57,390 --> 00:04:58,310
that submissive,

61
00:04:58,830 --> 00:04:59,720
reserved side of you.

62
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:04,120
Do you remember what I taught you?

63
00:05:05,430 --> 00:05:06,950
If the man before you

64
00:05:06,950 --> 00:05:08,480
were Zhao Junyao,

65
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:10,430
what would you do?

66
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:30,510
I...

67
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:32,190
I...

68
00:05:32,390 --> 00:05:33,800
Remember what I taught you today.

69
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,510
Tomorrow, the Crown Prince

70
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:37,120
will leave the palace
to provide disaster relief.

71
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,430
You must truly capture his attention.

72
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,390
Understood.

73
00:05:56,630 --> 00:05:57,950
You certainly ran off quickly.

74
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,630
Are the clothes I prepared

75
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:13,800
not good enough for you?

76
00:06:15,950 --> 00:06:18,240
The clothes Your Highness
gave me are too precious.

77
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,390
I'm afraid I'll ruin them.

78
00:06:19,630 --> 00:06:21,270
These clothes
are more practical for working.

79
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,040
He Xiaoyuan.

80
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:26,120
When will you understand?

81
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:28,920
His Highness is coming in person
to provide disaster relief

82
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:32,000
to put on a display of benevolence
for the people to praise,

83
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,920
not to actually

84
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:35,680
wash rice and light fires.

85
00:06:36,190 --> 00:06:37,720
A display?

86
00:06:41,190 --> 00:06:42,510
I'm sending you there

87
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,680
not to actually serve porridge,

88
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:47,680
but to make you the most striking sight

89
00:06:48,270 --> 00:06:50,000
in the scene
of benevolence he's created.

90
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,310
Every move you make

91
00:06:52,630 --> 00:06:53,800
must catch his eye.

92
00:06:56,190 --> 00:06:57,360
But I

93
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:59,680
just want to serve them
porridge for once,

94
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:02,040
so those victims can suffer
a little less from hunger and cold.

95
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:05,270
In the game I'm playing,

96
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:08,390
you don't get to change
the pieces on your own.

97
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:09,800
Go change.

98
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:11,870
I...

99
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,040
I don't want to change.

100
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:15,600
Let go of me. I won't change.

101
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:16,430
Go change.

102
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:35,040
Does Your Highness

103
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:37,070
intend to change my clothes personally?

104
00:07:37,870 --> 00:07:38,430
He Xiaoyuan.

105
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:39,480
How dare you!

106
00:07:46,070 --> 00:07:48,040
I'm the one you nearly saw naked.

107
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:49,680
How am I the one being improper?

108
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:12,830
Why aren't they serving porridge here?

109
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:15,270
The government only sets up
porridge stations along the main road.

110
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:16,920
There's no credit to be gained here,

111
00:08:17,270 --> 00:08:18,270
so naturally, there aren't any.

112
00:08:20,950 --> 00:08:22,950
Please, spare us some food.

113
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:24,800
Here.

114
00:08:26,950 --> 00:08:28,430
There's food!

115
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:32,790
Please give us some food.

116
00:08:33,790 --> 00:08:34,910
Don't fight.
There's enough for everyone.

117
00:08:35,270 --> 00:08:36,360
There's enough. Don't fight.

118
00:08:36,630 --> 00:08:37,360
Don't fight.

119
00:08:39,510 --> 00:08:40,630
Over here.

120
00:08:40,790 --> 00:08:42,080
You can't save everyone.

121
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,910
This bag of food

122
00:08:45,510 --> 00:08:46,790
might keep them alive for one day.

123
00:08:47,670 --> 00:08:48,600
But what about tomorrow?

124
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:51,080
Are you just going to watch them die?

125
00:08:51,390 --> 00:08:52,200
He Xiaoyuan.

126
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,600
After all you've seen

127
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,000
over these thirty-three lifetimes,

128
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,320
with every palace coup

129
00:08:58,550 --> 00:09:00,120
and every change of imperial power,

130
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,670
wherever war has spread,

131
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:03,910
the people have suffered

132
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,390
just as they are suffering now.

133
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,270
My father is indecisive.

134
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,600
The Crown Prince is weak.

135
00:09:11,270 --> 00:09:13,440
The court officials care
only about fighting for power.

136
00:09:14,630 --> 00:09:15,630
But who among them

137
00:09:16,670 --> 00:09:17,480
has ever truly

138
00:09:18,150 --> 00:09:19,720
looked down and seen
how these people live?

139
00:09:19,910 --> 00:09:20,630
(His Highness)

140
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:22,440
(is forcing me
to become the Crown Princess)

141
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,360
(not just to break this cycle)

142
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:26,080
(and help him ascend the throne.)

143
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:28,390
The reason I fight for the throne

144
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,600
is to put an end

145
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:32,150
to the people's endless suffering,

146
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:35,320
restore order to this troubled realm,

147
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:37,000
and root out all that is corrupt.

148
00:09:38,670 --> 00:09:40,840
That is what it truly means
to have Heaven's mandate.

149
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,720
(I thought Zhao Boqing)

150
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,200
(was merely
a ruthless political strategist.)

151
00:09:44,750 --> 00:09:45,550
(I never imagined)

152
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:46,790
(that his ambition)

153
00:09:47,030 --> 00:09:48,360
(was actually
for the sake of the people.)

154
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:50,270
He Xiaoyuan.

155
00:09:51,670 --> 00:09:52,480
Think carefully.

156
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:53,870
Will you follow me down this path?

157
00:10:02,150 --> 00:10:02,960
What

158
00:10:03,510 --> 00:10:04,360
should I do next?

159
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:08,960
Good.

160
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:09,840
Thank you.

161
00:10:11,270 --> 00:10:12,910
Everyone, don't worry.
There's enough for all.

162
00:10:18,550 --> 00:10:19,440
Thank you, Your Highness.

163
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:23,080
Your Highness.

164
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:24,600
What brings you here?

165
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,380
Your Highness cares deeply
for the people

166
00:10:26,380 --> 00:10:27,360
and has come
to aid the disaster victims.

167
00:10:28,030 --> 00:10:29,630
Such an act of benevolence

168
00:10:29,750 --> 00:10:31,270
is truly a blessing to all the people.

169
00:10:32,030 --> 00:10:32,630
I

170
00:10:32,910 --> 00:10:34,440
would like to do what little I can.

171
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:37,790
Thank you.

172
00:10:38,600 --> 00:10:39,550
Very well.

173
00:10:40,550 --> 00:10:41,000
Here.

174
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,150
Thank you.

175
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:44,960
Here.

176
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:45,720
Thank you.

177
00:10:51,150 --> 00:10:51,720
Thank you.

178
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:52,440
Your Highness.

179
00:10:52,630 --> 00:10:53,000
Go!

180
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:53,390
I...

181
00:10:53,870 --> 00:10:54,630
- Don't drive her away.
- Go!

182
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:55,840
She doesn't have the plague.

183
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:56,200
What's wrong?

184
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:56,390
Hurry!

185
00:10:56,390 --> 00:10:57,550
Don't drive her away.

186
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:58,750
Go!

187
00:10:58,750 --> 00:10:59,670
Don't drive her away.

188
00:10:59,670 --> 00:11:00,870
She doesn't have the plague.

189
00:11:00,870 --> 00:11:01,320
Go!

190
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,750
Leave her alone!

191
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:05,240
Let go of me!

192
00:11:05,670 --> 00:11:06,510
- Let her go.
- Go!

193
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:16,150
You're the Princess's study companion,

194
00:11:16,150 --> 00:11:16,840
He Xiaoyuan?

195
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:21,870
Your Highness.

196
00:11:22,790 --> 00:11:24,790
This child may have
a persistent high fever,

197
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:26,200
but she certainly
doesn't have the plague.

198
00:11:26,270 --> 00:11:27,720
It's just that the villages
north of the city

199
00:11:28,030 --> 00:11:29,240
are desperately short
of doctors and medicine.

200
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,320
Please look into this, Your Highness.

201
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:32,910
North of the city?

202
00:11:34,150 --> 00:11:35,960
Haven't food and medicine
been distributed there?

203
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:37,790
Your Highness,

204
00:11:38,050 --> 00:11:39,390
there are too many
displaced people north of the city,

205
00:11:39,390 --> 00:11:40,790
so the area wasn't
included in this relief effort.

206
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:41,840
Absurd!

207
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:45,080
Father ordered me to oversee
the disaster relief in person.

208
00:11:45,670 --> 00:11:47,440
How can I address
only the most immediate needs?

209
00:11:48,080 --> 00:11:49,910
Send people north of the city at once!

210
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:50,750
Yes.

211
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:56,480
Rise and speak.

212
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:02,340
Thank you, Your Highness.

213
00:12:02,980 --> 00:12:04,130
Quickly, have one
of the Imperial Physicians

214
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:05,150
come examine this child.

215
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:07,030
Go.

216
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:10,670
You're a defenseless young woman,

217
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:12,120
yet you ventured
into a remote village alone.

218
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:13,270
In such a dangerous place,

219
00:12:13,630 --> 00:12:14,630
why would you risk your life?

220
00:12:14,750 --> 00:12:15,320
I

221
00:12:15,510 --> 00:12:16,550
come from a poor family.

222
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:19,030
I know well how the common people
suffer from hunger and cold.

223
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:20,000
So

224
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:21,670
I only wanted to

225
00:12:21,670 --> 00:12:22,840
truly do something
for the disaster victims.

226
00:12:23,270 --> 00:12:24,030
Xiaoyuan.

227
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,750
I never realized before

228
00:12:26,750 --> 00:12:28,080
that you had such compassion.

229
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:30,270
There's a flower-viewing banquet
at the palace in three days.

230
00:12:30,550 --> 00:12:32,030
I'd like to invite you
to attend with me.

231
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:33,600
We can also discuss

232
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:35,240
the next steps
for the victims north of the city.

233
00:12:35,870 --> 00:12:36,360
I

234
00:12:36,670 --> 00:12:37,600
thank Your Highness

235
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:38,700
on behalf of the victims
north of the city.

236
00:12:39,150 --> 00:12:40,600
At least you've made some progress.

237
00:12:43,550 --> 00:12:44,320
Young Lady.

238
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:46,960
His Highness truly
can't tell a pearl from a pebble.

239
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:48,870
Everything you did today
was clearly for his sake,

240
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:49,840
yet he showed special favor

241
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:51,600
to a mere study companion

242
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:53,550
and even invited her
to the flower-viewing banquet.

243
00:12:53,550 --> 00:12:54,480
He Xiaoyuan.

244
00:12:55,150 --> 00:12:57,390
That woman keeps appearing
before His Highness

245
00:12:57,390 --> 00:12:58,390
just to attract his attention.

246
00:12:58,750 --> 00:13:00,870
Her vile intentions are plain to see.

247
00:13:01,750 --> 00:13:02,750
Go back and keep an eye on her.

248
00:13:03,030 --> 00:13:04,080
I'd like to see

249
00:13:04,750 --> 00:13:05,910
what tricks she can pull

250
00:13:06,270 --> 00:13:07,390
at the flower-viewing banquet.

251
00:13:08,030 --> 00:13:08,440
Yes.

252
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:09,000
Miss.

253
00:13:12,740 --> 00:13:14,660
(Qingyan Palace)

254
00:13:14,670 --> 00:13:16,840
The Crown Prince
did notice your act of kindness.

255
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:19,240
But his admiration will quickly fade.

256
00:13:20,790 --> 00:13:22,000
He's merely an ordinary man

257
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:25,000
easily captivated by beauty.

258
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:26,150
You must

259
00:13:26,150 --> 00:13:28,550
make a stunning impression
at the flower-viewing banquet in three days

260
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:30,910
to win his heart.

261
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:34,600
But the banquet will
be filled with distinguished guests,

262
00:13:34,750 --> 00:13:36,910
and there will
be many ladies skilled in poetry.

263
00:13:37,510 --> 00:13:38,910
How could I possibly compete with them?

264
00:13:43,020 --> 00:13:43,480
Your Highness...

265
00:13:43,480 --> 00:13:43,910
Speak.

266
00:13:46,910 --> 00:13:47,550
Your Highness.

267
00:13:47,910 --> 00:13:48,720
The secret guards reported

268
00:13:49,670 --> 00:13:51,360
that Miss Xiaoyuan's
parents' tuberculosis

269
00:13:51,360 --> 00:13:52,270
has worsened recently.

270
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:53,790
They coughed up blood all night.

271
00:13:56,550 --> 00:13:58,790
Please allow me
to take leave and return home.

272
00:13:59,450 --> 00:14:00,761
The Imperial Medical Service has
century-old lingzhi.

273
00:14:00,761 --> 00:14:01,490
It can ease tuberculosis.

274
00:14:01,670 --> 00:14:02,480
Fetch it at once.

275
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:04,150
But today,

276
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:05,960
the century-old lingzhi
was also chosen as the prize

277
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:07,080
for the winner
of the flower-viewing banquet.

278
00:14:10,750 --> 00:14:12,360
So first place

279
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:15,360
is something I must win.

280
00:14:26,250 --> 00:14:28,560
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

281
00:14:28,910 --> 00:14:30,600
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

282
00:14:31,230 --> 00:14:34,240
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

283
00:14:34,750 --> 00:14:39,080
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

284
